		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>After fifteen years in this industry, I've learned that true style isn't about chasing trends but finding pieces that resonate with your personal aesthetic while offering genuine quality and versatility.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>I'm excited to share a few thoughtful additions to my summer wardrobe from a boutique I recently discovered that emphasizes craftsmanship over fast fashion.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

