<!-- wp:group {"layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The foundation of my summer rotation begins with the Men's Crewneck. </p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>A piece that exemplifies the "less is more" philosophy I've come to embrace. </p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The clean lines and premium cotton blend create a silhouette that transitions effortlessly from casual daytime meetings to evening gatherings. </p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>While the price point reflects its quality, I've found that investing in well-constructed basics ultimately reduces the cost-per-wear ratio significantly over time.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {"layout":{"type":"flex","flexWrap":"nowrap"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group"><!-- wp:group {"layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>For accessories, I've been drawn to these understated Black Sunnies that offer both UV protection and a classic profile that complements virtually any outfit. </p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>What I appreciate most about these sunglasses is their restraint-they protect your eyes without overwhelming your face, allowing other elements of your ensemble to speak. They're reminiscent of styles I've returned to year after year, proving that certain designs truly transcend seasonal trends.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

