<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>I'm grateful to have found pieces that will likely remain in my rotation for years to come, rather than months-a perspective that's become increasingly important to me as I consider both my personal style and environmental footprint.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>While I'm fortunate that my recommendations resonate with many of you, I encourage everyone to consider their own lifestyle needs and budget constraints when building their wardrobe. </p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>These pieces work for me, but thoughtful consumption should always take precedence over impulse purchasing.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p></p>
